>
  <h2>What we make</h2>
  <p>Our showroom at Rajhans Ornate, Parle Point, Surat holds natural diamond necklaces and sets, <a href="/solitaire-rings">certified solitaire rings</a>, cluster rings, earrings, bangles, bracelets, pendants and mangalsutras, from everyday pieces to bridal jewellery.</p>
  <figure class="vj-fig"><div class="vj-fig-frame"><img class="vj-photo-img" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_rough_20261111130944" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_480/vj/concept/web_sec_rough_20261111130944 480w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_rough_20261111130944 720w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_960/vj/concept/web_sec_rough_20261111130944 960w" sizes="(max-width: 520px) 92vw, 460px" width="720" height="900" alt="A natural rough diamond crystal next to a polished round brilliant diamond" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="vj-mark sm" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logo_mark_on_dark.png" alt="" width="45" height="30" loading="lazy" /></span></div></figure>

  <h2>Certified and hallmarked</h2>
  <p>Diamonds come with certificates from recognised laboratories such as IGI, TGL and EGL where applicable, and our gold jewellery carries BIS HUID hallmarking. We explain every certificate in simple terms before you buy.</p>
  <figure class="vj-fig"><div class="vj-fig-frame"><img class="vj-photo-img" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_huid_20261111130822" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_480/vj/concept/web_sec_huid_20261111130822 480w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_huid_20261111130822 720w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_960/vj/concept/web_sec_huid_20261111130822 960w" sizes="(max-width: 520px) 92vw, 460px" width="720" height="900" alt="BIS hallmark with HUID on the inside of an 18 karat gold diamond ring" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="vj-mark sm" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logo_mark_on_dark.png" alt="" width="45" height="30" loading="lazy" /></span></div></figure>

  <h2>Made your way</h2>
  <p>Because we manufacture in-house, you can take any design and change the gold karat, the diamond quality or the design itself. Share a photo or an idea and we will guide you through the options.</p>
  <figure class="vj-fig"><div class="vj-fig-frame"><img class="vj-photo-img" src="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_karigar_20261111131036" srcset="https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_480/vj/concept/web_sec_karigar_20261111131036 480w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_720/vj/concept/web_sec_karigar_20261111131036 720w, https://res.cloudinary.com/rknejib2/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto,c_fill,ar_4:5,g_auto,w_960/vj/concept/web_sec_karigar_20261111131036 960w" sizes="(max-width: 520px) 92vw, 460px" width="720" height="900" alt="Craftsman setting diamonds into a gold necklace in the Vaishnavi Jewels manufacturing unit, Surat" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /><span class="vj-mark sm" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/logo_mark_on_dark.png" alt="" width="45" height="30" loading="lazy" /></span></div></figure>

  <h2>Buying from outside Surat</h2>
  <p>We guide you personally on WhatsApp, accept payment by NEFT or UPI, and ship with free insured delivery to major Indian cities. See <a href="/delivery-across-india">Delivery across India</a>, our <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>, or <a href="/visit-us">visit our showroom</a>.</p>
</InfoPage>
